BOOK:Constraints
NUMBER: 1 CONDITION: Point_Constraints
CONDTYPE: over points
CONDMESHTYPE: over nodes
HELP: Use this condition to prescribe the displacement or rotation of points.\nEvery marked flag will prescribe the movement for that degree of freedom.\nThe values fields permmit to set a prescribed displacement or rotation for that degree.\nUnits in International System for values are:\n\t (m) for the displacements\n\t(rad) for the rotations.
TITLE: Flags
QUESTION: Local_Axes#LA#(-GLOBAL-)
VALUE: -GLOBAL-
HELP: If the direction to prescribe is not coincident with the global axes, it is possible to define a set of local axes and prescribe the displacements related to that local axes. To see the defined local axes use button 'Draw'.
QUESTION: X_Constraint#CB#(1,0)
VALUE: 1
DEPENDENCIES: (0,SET,X_Value,0.0)(#DEFAULT#,RESTORE,X_Value,#CURRENT#)
QUESTION: Y_Constraint#CB#(1,0)
