NUMBER: 2 CONDITION: Point_Elastic_Constraints
CONDTYPE: over points
CONDMESHTYPE: over nodes
HELP: Use this condition to apply an elastic spring to the displacement or rotation of points.\nEvery marked flag will prescribe the spring for that degree of freedom.\nEnter the stiffness constant for every actived degree of freedom in the values fields.\nUnits in International System for stiffness constants are:\n\t (N/m) for the displacements\n\t(N*m/rad) for the rotations.
