NUMBER: 16 CONDITION: Shell_Face_Load
CONDTYPE: over lines
CONDMESHTYPE: over face elements
HELP: A static pressure load over the contour of the shell given in global axes or in user defined axes. Units in International System for values are:\n\t (N/m) for the shell contour pressures.
QUESTION: Local_Axes#LA#(-GLOBAL-,-Automatic-,-Automatic_alt-)
VALUE: -GLOBAL-
HELP: It is possible to define a set of local axes and enter the values of the pressure related to that local axes. Option 'Automatic' permmit to assign a load normal or tangent to the curved lines. To see the defined local axes use button 'Draw'.
