END CONDITION
NUMBER: 19 CONDITION: Shell_triangular_Load
CONDTYPE: over surfaces
CONDMESHTYPE: over body elements
HELP: This load is similar to that of 'global shell load' but its intensity changes depending on the point where it is applied. The two points define an imaginary line in the space. For every point of the surface where the load is applied, it is possible to project this point on the line and interpolate the values related to these points depending on where it is projected. \nUnits in International System for values are:\n\t (m) for the points\n\t(N/m2) for the pressures.
