NUMBER: 20 CONDITION: Shell_hydrostatic_face_Load
CONDTYPE: over lines
CONDMESHTYPE: over face elements
HELP: This is a triangular load that has value 0.0 at the reference coordinate (in the sense of the gravity) and gives an hydrostatic pressure that depends on the self-weight of the water or terrain. \nUnits in International System for values are:\n\t (m) for the coordinates\n\t(N/m3) for the self-weight.
QUESTION: Units#CB#(N-m-kg,N-cm-kg,N-mm-kg,Kp-cm-utm)
VALUE: N-m-kg
QUESTION: Reference_coordinate:
VALUE: 0.0
QUESTION: Self_weight_water:
VALUE: 10000
END CONDITION
